  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Explanation for Handling Data Quality Issues\n",
    "- Duplicate Data: Removed duplicate rows to ensure each record is unique.\n",
    "- Missing Data: Imputed missing values in the 'CreditScore' column with the mean value.\n",
    "- Data Inconsistencies: Replaced 'Geography' values with standardized codes (FR, ES, DE) and imputed missing values with the mode."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
