  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Explanation of Encoding Techniques\n",
    "- Frequency Encoding: Encodes categorical variables based on the frequency of their values.\n",
    "- Target Encoding: Encodes categorical variables based on the mean of the target variable for each category.\n",
    "- Leave-One-Out Encoding: Similar to target encoding, but excludes the current row's target value to prevent data leakage."
